# Build context for the Java images (deploy/compose/java/Dockerfile), whose context is the repo root:
# Gradle compiles the modules inside the build stage, so the sources and the wrapper go in; build
# outputs, caches and everything the Java build doesn't read stay out. (The dashboard and the demo
# database have their own contexts and ignore files.)
